---
// Go control flow (single 'for' keyword, scoped if, breakless switch) + LIFO defer stack cleanup.
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="gf1d">
  <div class="gf1d-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Control flow constructs in Go including unified for loops, scoped if declarations, breakless switch statements, and LIFO defer stack execution on function return.">
      {/* Left panel: Control flow idioms */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="424" height="254" rx="10" class="gf1d-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf1d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Minimalist control flow (1 loop, safe switch)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Rẽ nhánh &amp; vòng lặp gọn nhẹ trong Go</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="392" height="60" rx="6" class="gf1d-box" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="gf1d-b">One loop keyword: for  (no while / do-while)</text>
      <text x="44" y="99" class="gf1d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>for i:=0; i&lt;n; i++  |  for cond  |  for {}  |  for i, v := range xs</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>for chuẩn 3 phần  |  for điều kiện  |  for vô hạn  |  for range</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="130" width="392" height="58" rx="6" class="gf1d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="150" class="gf1d-b-ok">Scoped init: if v, err := parse(); err != nil</text>
      <text x="44" y="169" class="gf1d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>v &amp; err stay scoped strictly inside the if/else block.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Biến v &amp; err chỉ sống gọn trong cụm if, tránh rò tên ra ngoài.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="198" width="392" height="54" rx="6" class="gf1d-box" />
      <text x="44" y="218" class="gf1d-b">Switch auto-breaks by default (no accidental fallthrough)</text>
      <text x="44" y="237" class="gf1d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Supports comma cases ("GET", "HEAD") &amp; conditionless switch.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không cần gõ break cuối mỗi case; gộp nhiều case trên 1 dòng.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: LIFO defer stack */}
      <rect x="462" y="14" width="424" height="254" rx="10" class="gf1d-card" />
      <text x="478" y="42" class="gf1d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. LIFO defer Stack (Last-In, First-Out cleanup)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Cơ chế dọn dẹp LIFO của defer khi thoát hàm</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="478" y="60" width="188" height="128" rx="6" class="gf1d-box" />
      <text x="492" y="80" class="gf1d-b">Execution order:</text>
      <text x="492" y="102" class="gf1d-m">1. defer push(1)</text>
      <text x="492" y="122" class="gf1d-m">2. defer push(2)</text>
      <text x="492" y="142" class="gf1d-m">3. defer push(3)</text>
      <text x="492" y="166" class="gf1d-b-red">4. func returns →</text>

      <line x1="670" y1="124" x2="696" y2="124" class="gf1d-wire-ok" />
      <polygon points="702,124 694,119 694,129" class="gf1d-head-ok" />

      <rect x="706" y="60" width="164" height="128" rx="6" class="gf1d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="720" y="80" class="gf1d-b-ok">Popped Stack:</text>
      <rect x="720" y="92" width="136" height="24" rx="4" class="gf1d-cell" />
      <text x="730" y="108" class="gf1d-b">Runs 1st: 3</text>
      <rect x="720" y="122" width="136" height="24" rx="4" class="gf1d-cell" />
      <text x="730" y="138" class="gf1d-b">Runs 2nd: 2</text>
      <rect x="720" y="152" width="136" height="24" rx="4" class="gf1d-cell" />
      <text x="730" y="168" class="gf1d-b">Runs 3rd: 1</text>

      <rect x="478" y="198" width="392" height="54" rx="6" class="gf1d-box" />
      <text x="492" y="218" class="gf1d-b">Pair open/lock right next to defer Close()/Unlock()</text>
      <text x="492" y="237" class="gf1d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Args evaluate at defer line; body runs reversed ([3 2 1]).</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chốt tham số lúc gọi defer; thân chạy ngược [3 2 1] khi return.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Go removes while/do-while and fallthrough switch bugs while defer queues cleanup calls onto a Last-In, First-Out stack so f.Close() stays right beneath os.Open().</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Go bỏ vòng while dư thừa và tự ngắt từng nhánh switch; còn từ khóa defer đẩy lệnh đóng file/mở khóa vào ngăn xếp LIFO chạy ngược lúc thoát hàm để khỏi quên dọn tài nguyên.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf1d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf1d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf1d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf1d text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf1d-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf1d-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf1d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1d-cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gf1d-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf1d-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf1d-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf1d-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1d-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1d-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf1d-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .gf1d-head-ok { fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1d-wire-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1d-head-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
